# Move mode on a long home grid (study 046 P2): 20 tiles, 7 rows of 3, at 640x480 (the deck: 2 rows in view) and
# 480x800 (PDA portrait on the profile pda: 5 rows in view). The carried tile goes from the first row to the last and
# back with the arrows, then halfway and a tap on the next tile places it. The view follows by the least scroll that
# shows the carried tile whole: no row snapped to the top, no blank space under the last row nor above the first
# (expect_grid_view), and the outline only while the tile is wholly in the grid. Review only: no golden.
title home move rows
review
sizes 640x480 480x800
@480x800 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
keyboards 1
apps Settings Klondike CLI Python SSH "IP Panel" Calculator Snake Tank 2048=fixture:2048_128.png "Mesh Hop=ip_panel_100.png" "RSS Reader=fixture:store_100.png" "Net Toolbox=ssh_100.png" "Serial Console=cli_100.png" Notes=math_100.png Maps=game_100.png Radio=tank_100.png Weather=setting_100.png Clock=python_100.png Files=cli_100.png
home
# Settings (the first tile, selected) picked up with Ctrl+O
key CTRL+O
shot move_rows_picked
expect_grid_view Settings
# down to the last row (slot 18 of 20; a seventh Down stays)
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
shot move_rows_bottom
expect_grid_view Settings
expect_tiles Klondike CLI Python SSH "IP Panel" Calculator Snake Tank 2048 "Mesh Hop" "RSS Reader" "Net Toolbox" "Serial Console" Notes Maps Radio Weather Clock Settings Files
# and back to the first row
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
shot move_rows_top
expect_grid_view Settings
expect_tiles Settings Klondike CLI Python SSH "IP Panel" Calculator Snake Tank 2048 "Mesh Hop" "RSS Reader" "Net Toolbox" "Serial Console" Notes Maps Radio Weather Clock Files
# halfway (slot 9, the fourth row), then a tap on Mesh Hop (slot 10): placed there and dropped, the grid rebuilt with
# the tile in view
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
shot move_rows_middle
expect_grid_view Settings
tapbutton "Mesh Hop"
shot move_rows_tap
expect_grid_view Settings
expect_tiles Klondike CLI Python SSH "IP Panel" Calculator Snake Tank 2048 "Mesh Hop" Settings "RSS Reader" "Net Toolbox" "Serial Console" Notes Maps Radio Weather Clock Files
# a press and the 3 s hold on a tile in the second row of the grid do not move the grid (LVGL's click focus used to
# scroll the pressed tile's row to the top); the hold is then given up
key ESC
home
shot hold_before
grid_scroll_mark SSH
touchbutton SSH
wait 1300
shot hold_bar
expect_grid_scroll_same SSH
release
